<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-14T12:12:38.522Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:12:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan’s security forces have killed five terrorists in Balochistan’s Washuk district and five more in operations in Bannu, while authorities charged Afridi and four others over the 2023 Radio Pakistan attack. The Taliban have suspended BBC broadcasts across Afghanistan and are leveraging European concerns about migrants, while Afghanistan’s road to China remains stalled. Pakistan and the EU are discussing migration and border-security cooperation, and Pakistan has imposed emergency rule in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, a move that could affect its ties with Afghanistan. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/12/world/asia/europe-taliban-deportations-migrants.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/14/world/asia/afghanistan-taliban-suspends-bbc.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1qdDNmZWhZLUg0RGJ0Sk9MVTFSSUtTZ21oU05HV0N5VE9BWThLV29iZWsxQzYzQ3JFYkFmWlhSOE04OXpvTUZNXw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9ESnA3dkxrWmdqck1uUFozd2o1TUFMOFEwelFjT3pMd0VrOTJTcWc3Q2x3MndNZW1MOUlYLUptcjlDekVZNHJGTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9ZNEZVY2hNRVlVamw1VjJrNEhNTmNIVlVxcVBQcWZzMGVpYWlCdnc1WUxiR1lYY1RfVVNrVV9ZYzIwUFM1NF9nYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBGX0hVRWNRY3hjQjA2SjVkdFdpR2dsTGJKQVdGNmhyd2hUNWZld2JCczlfemZndWFTbFFxSzA1REk3VldEM0dOVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;